{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":25,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["一首讚美詩"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，你是我的上帝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要尊崇你，我要稱讚你的名。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你以忠信誠實行過奇妙的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成就你古時所定的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使城變為亂堆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使堅固城變為荒場，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使外邦人宮殿的城不再為城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"永遠不再建造。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，剛強的民必榮耀你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"強暴之國的城必敬畏你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為當強暴人催逼人的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同暴風直吹牆壁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你就作貧窮人的保障，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作困乏人急難中的保障，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作躲暴風之處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作避炎熱的陰涼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要壓制外邦人的喧嘩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像乾燥地的熱氣下落；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"禁止強暴人的凱歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像熱氣被雲影消化。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝為萬民設擺筵席"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["在這山上，萬軍之耶和華必為萬民用肥甘設擺筵席，用陳酒和滿髓的肥甘，並澄清的陳酒，設擺筵席。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他又必在這山上除滅遮蓋萬民之物和遮蔽萬國蒙臉的帕子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他已經吞滅死亡直到永遠。主耶和華必擦去各人臉上的眼淚，又除掉普天下他百姓的羞辱，因為這是耶和華說的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["到那日，人必說：「看哪，這是我們的上帝；我們素來等候他，他必拯救我們。這是耶和華，我們素來等候他，我們必因他的救恩歡喜快樂。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝要刑罰摩押"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶和華的手必按在這山上；摩押人在所居之地必被踐踏，好像乾草被踐踏在糞池的水中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["他必在其中伸開手，好像洑水的伸開手洑水一樣；但耶和華必使他的驕傲和他手所行的詭計一併敗落。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["耶和華使你城上的堅固高臺傾倒，拆平，直到塵埃。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/25.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/26.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/24.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}